.SS "double sc_keyvalue_get_double (\fBsc_keyvalue_t\fP * kv, const char * key, double dvalue)"

.PP
Retrieve a double value by its key\&. This function asserts that the key, if existing, points to the correct type\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIkv\fP Valid key-value container\&. 
.br
\fIkey\fP Lookup key, may or may not exist\&. 
.br
\fIdvalue\fP Default value returned if key is not found\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
If key is not present then \fBdvalue\fP is returned, otherwise the value stored under \fBkey\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

